              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okuviira irala ku kubatizibwa kwa Yoanne okutuuka ku lunaku lwe yatutoolebwaku ng'atwalibwa mu igulu, tufunemu mulala abe n'ife mu kudhulira okuzuukira kwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
